{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/68b9b68a36cca4c8a984853658ddf7d4.webp?t=1746142050\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/3d6c726168396d9afae74f6cc45fea4d.poster.avif?t=1746142050\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/3d6c726168396d9afae74f6cc45fea4d.webm?t=1746142050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/3d6c726168396d9afae74f6cc45fea4d.mp4?t=1746142050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Salvage Protocol</strong> is a single-player horror game about infiltrating abandoned space stations. Break anything in sight, recover valuable components, dodge traps and fight off terrifying monsters hiding in plain sight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And maybe one day YOU will pay off your debt to the S.R.P.O. mega-corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/a08430efd872ffcb22a54584c76f2b13.poster.avif?t=1746142050\" width=800 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/a08430efd872ffcb22a54584c76f2b13.webm?t=1746142050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/a08430efd872ffcb22a54584c76f2b13.mp4?t=1746142050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl